  "name": "Supercar Track",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "author": "idv7lol contributors",
  "description": "A track cluster in the style of Italian supercars: a wide rev arc counting to 9, a huge gear in the middle, oil, water and fuel columns at the sides, speed bottom right. Fuel and range show dashes on the car until those signals are read.",
